---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content'; import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
const guides=(await getCollection('getStarted',({data})=>!data.draft)).sort((a,b)=>a.data.order-b.data.order);
---
<BaseLayout title="Get Started" description="Instale e valide as ferramentas necessárias para executar laboratórios de containers, Kubernetes, Helm e GitOps."><div class="container-shell py-14"><Breadcrumb items={[{label:'Início',href:'/'},{label:'Get Started'}]} /><header class="mt-10 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Prepare seu ambiente</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-black text-slate-950 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl">Get Started</h1><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Instalação verificável, escolha consciente das ferramentas e troubleshooting antes de começar os laboratórios.</p></header><ol class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">{guides.map((guide,index)=><li><a href={`/get-started/${guide.id}/`} class="surface block h-full p-6 transition hover:border-sky-400"><p class="font-mono text-xs text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-400">ETAPA {index+1}</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">{guide.data.title}</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">{guide.data.description}</p><p class="mt-5 text-xs text-slate-500">{guide.data.platforms.join(' · ')}</p></a></li>)}</ol><aside class="mt-14 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-amber-950 dark:border-amber-900 dark:bg-amber-950/20 dark:text-amber-100">Não instale kind e Minikube obrigatoriamente: escolha o ambiente adequado. Os labs informam quando dependem especificamente de um deles.</aside></div></BaseLayout>
